Moving Average (3-win, 90s) & 0.7158 & 0.7822 & 16.51 \\
Moving Average (5-win, 150s) & 0.7196 & 0.7865 & 15.92 \\
Moving Average (9-win, 270s) & \textbf{0.7236} & \textbf{0.7909} & \textbf{15.30} \\
HMM ($p_{\text{af}} = 0.90$) & 0.6189 & 0.6769 & 28.04 \\
HMM ($p_{\text{af}} = 0.95$) & 0.6148 & 0.6726 & 28.45 \\
